1
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:05,465
Paste an organization, and Skill Atlas finds every skill in it

2
00:00:05,565 --> 00:00:06,810
Grouped by repository, with a heads-up for broken files

3
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,082
Type to filter — matches light up instantly

4
00:00:08,182 --> 00:00:09,850
A typo? You get a clear message, not a broken page

5
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,950
Every task starts as an issue labelled “Delegated to AI” —
from you, or from the Red Agent hunting bugs

6
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,050
Air picks it up and opens a pull request…

7
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,150
…or asks on Slack first, if something is unclear

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,350
Then it reviews the PR, answers the comments,
and tests it when you ask

9
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,850
And whenever you like, a status update lands in Slack
